		c	The bit in the networking protocol version for denoting {@linkplain #SNAPSHOT snapshot versions}.\n\n@see #SNAPSHOT_NETWORK_PROTOCOL_VERSION
	f	Lnet/minecraft/WorldVersion;	CURRENT_VERSION	bi	field_16742
