c	net/minecraft/world/level/storage/loot/GsonAdapterFactory	dzi	net/minecraft/class_5330
	c	Creates Gson serializers based on {@link SerializerType} and {@link Serializer}.\nThe resulting serializers handle JSON in the following structure:\n<code>\n{\n  "type": "minecraft:example",\n  "otherProperties": "go here"\n}\n</code>\n\nThe {@code "type"} property is read (with a fallback to {@code defaultType}) and then looked up in the provided registry to produce the {@code SerializerType}. The type's {@code Serializer} is then used to deserialize the rest of the JSON object.\n\nIf the serializer receives a JSON element that is not an object, it will try to use the {@code InlineSerializer} if provided.
